# Sandboxed GD copy (~400MB app bundle + game state). Recreate with:
#   ditto "<steam>/Geometry Dash.app" sandbox/"Geometry Dash.app"
# See README.md. Never commit a copy of the game.
sandbox/

# Personal save data. Contains the real GD profile — must never leave this machine.
backups/

# Build output. mod/build alone is ~790MB (CPM deps, codegen, object files).
mod/build/
# ...and as a bare name too: mod/build is a SYMLINK on this machine, pointing
# out of the repo to /Users/rexouyang/gdrl-build. ~/Desktop is iCloud-synced,
# and a build tree living there gets its files evicted to the cloud, after
# which every read blocks on the file provider -- 933 files totalling 1.2MB
# measured at 119s to read, at 0% CPU. That is what made `geode build` appear
# to hang at `-- Running Codegen` for 25 minutes. A trailing-slash pattern
# matches directories only, so without this bare entry the symlink shows up as
# untracked and can be committed, baking one machine's absolute path into the
# repo.
mod/build
build/
*.geode
*.dylib
*.o
*.a

